---
import { Card, CardGrid } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
---

<section class="py-8 lg:py-16">
  <h2 class="py-4 text-center">
    What’s so great about
    <span class="font-extrabold whitespace-nowrap">Git Audio</span>?
  </h2>
  <CardGrid stagger class="mt-8">
    <Card title="Cross-platform" icon="seti:audio">
      Works on macOS and Linux, using various audio players that you already know.
    </Card>
    <Card title="Quick and easy" icon="download">
      Install with a single command, no dependencies, no fuss.
    </Card>
    <Card title="Command line interface" icon="seti:shell">
      Configure Git Audio from anywhere with a simple and intuitive CLI.
    </Card>
    <Card title="Let’s get started!" icon="open-book">
      Check out the <a href="/intro">guide</a> to install and start using Git Audio today.
    </Card>
  </CardGrid>
</section>
